时做量了解掌握火灾逃生的基本方法，熟悉儿童逃生路线", "block_bbox": [450, 953, 519, 1022], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[450.0, 953.0], [519.0, 953.0], [519.0, 1022.0], [450.0, 1022.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "受到火灾威胁时，要当机立断披上浸湿的衣物，被褥等向安全出口方向冲击", "block_bbox": [659, 954, 739, 1022], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[659.0, 954.0], [739.0, 954.0], [739.0, 1022.0], [659.0, 1022.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "火灾袭来时要迅速逃生，不要自恋财物。", "block_bbox": [440, 1081, 518, 1123], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[440.0, 1081.0], [518.0, 1081.0], [518.0, 1123.0], [440.0, 1123.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "家用电器或旅游者火，要先信游电源，再用干粉或气体灭火器灭火，不可直接泼水灭火，以结触电或电器爆炸伤人。", "block_bbox": [887, 938, 956, 1036], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[887.0, 938.0], [956.0, 938.0], [956.0, 1036.0], [887.0, 1036.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "若所有进生浅随被大火，要立即退回室内，用手电筒、挥舞衣物、呼叫等方式向窗外袭送求救信号，等待救援", "block_bbox": [668, 1053, 738, 1149], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[668.0, 1053.0], [738.0, 1053.0], [738.0, 1149.0], [668.0, 1149.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [751, 1049, 871, 1155], "block_id": 6, "block_order": null, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[751.0, 1049.0], [871.0, 1049.0], [871.0, 1155.0], [751.0, 1155.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "墙上着火，千万不要着地，可就地打滚或用湿重的衣物压灭火苗。", "block_bbox": [878, 1073, 956, 1129], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[878.0, 1073.0], [956.0, 1073.0], [956.0, 1129.0], [878.0, 1129.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [226, 1249, 284, 1306], "block_id": 8, "block_order": null, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[226.0, 1249.0], [284.0, 1249.0], [284.0, 1306.0], [226.0, 1306.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_titl